{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And I will shake [them] among all the nations</b> — that they were exiled to Halah and Habor and the cities of Media." "<b>And the meaning of 'not a pebble shall fall to the earth'</b> — as he said: 'for I will not destroy the house of Jacob entirely, only a small part of it alone.' And Yefet said: all the kingdoms of the earth He will destroy, but Israel alone will remain. And the interpretation of 'the booth of David' — concerning Hezekiah, who escaped from the hand of Sennacherib, and his name went forth afar, and so it is written:"], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:41.026775249Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}